        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.8.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 8:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mawe, iwe enyunyuuzi ey'omu rukyakya, iwe kizaarwa emamba! Iwe ayasinguraga amahanga na iwe okatemwa wagwa ha nsi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.11.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 11:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.10.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 10:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okaikara nooteekereza oti: “Nditemba omwiguru; ekitebe kyange eky'obukama, ndikita haiguru y'enyunyuuzi za Ruhanga; ndisinga ha rusozi orunyakuli hara ha bukiizi obw'emoso; nambere abantu baliba beesorooliize; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nditemba haiguru muno mpingule ebicu, ndyesisaniza nk'Ogu anyakuli haiguru muno.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu omu kiikaro eky'okugenda oku olesirwe nyabuyonga omu kicweka ekihamire kukira byona, omunsi ey'abafu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo abaraakurora, nibaija kukugumyaho amaiso bahunirre nibagamba bati: “Baitu onu, nuwe omusaija oli ayaleeteraga ensi kukankana, nuwe ruteengeesa makama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuwe ayafoire ensi irungu yahwerekereza embuga zaayo, nuwe ataralekeraga abanyankomo be bakagaruka owaabo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakama ab'amahanga, babyamire n'ekitiinisa, buli omu ali omu gasani ye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "0aitu iwe, bakwihire omu gasani yawe baakunaga aheeru, omutumbi gwawe, gubuutikirwe emitumbi ey'abaserikale abaagwire omu bulemu, baaguhungura nseri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu habwokuba okahwerekereza ensi yawe, waita abantu bawe, tolitabaazibwa nk'abakama abandi. “Baijukuru b'enkozi z'ebibi, bataligaruka kugambwaho! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutegeke ibaagiro habw'abanabe habwokusiisa kwa baisebo, bataliija kwimuka bakalya ensi n'ensi yoona bakagisweka embugo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'amahe naagamba ati: “Ndiimuka mbarwanise, ndibuuleeza Bbabbulooni ereke kugaruka kugambwaho, tihalibaho n'omu asigaraho, abaana n'abaijukuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndigifoora kiikaro ky'enyamunungu, ndigitamu ebiijongo by'amaizi, ndigisingorra n'ekisingolezo, ekirisingorra buli kintu kikakitwara hara.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
