        },
        {
          "text": "“Inywe abantu ba Firisitiya inywena, muleke kwesiima, ngu habwokuba omwigo ogwabatiire gucwekere, habwokuba obu hafa enjoka emu, omu kiikaro kyayo, hagarukamu erukukira obubi, kandi egi ekyana eki erizaara eriba njoka kahurruka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
